n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users  1949 Aug 30 05:35 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\n--- git log ---\nbfd358b morning-ledger: Archive the stop-state, then render the morning ledger and the announcement draft\nd618da6 bench-harness: Measurement harness: honest client and counterbalanced matrix\n754e111 host-tooling: Pair-service orchestration: env doctrine, cluster up/down, first-light runner\nff1731c container-recipe: Container recipe: pinned wheel set + engine fork built from source\n34f5426 docs: appendix A — community RDMA-method prediction, assessed against our evidence\ne7ffa66 docs: preserve the round-2 decision record — every chain, dissent, and flip-trigger\nefc4b1f round-2 finalization: README rewrite, ROCm 10 correction + probe lane, kingjones evidence, arm checklist\n520f24b round-2 crystallization: worklist + pre-arm serve/transport/receipt repairs\n--- status ---\n--- handoff dir ---\ntotal 80\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 tom users  4096 Aug 30 05:35 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 13 tom users  4096 Aug 30 05:35 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users  5947 Aug 30 05:35 DAYRUN-NOTES.md\ndrwxr-xr-x  5 tom users  4096 Aug 30 05:35 harvest-2026-08-29\n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users  4373 Aug 30 05:35 OVERSEER-LAUNCH.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users 13168 Aug 30 05:35 OVERSEER.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users  9921 Aug 30 05:35 PREARM-REBOOT.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users  5567 Aug 30 05:35 ROUND2-ARM-CHECKLIST.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users  6149 Aug 30 05:35 ROUTING.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 tom users  2935 Aug 30 05:35 TALLY-FINDINGS.md\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 tom users  4096 Aug 30 05:35 upstream-issues","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
