ithout it the 02:30 fetch timer re-downloads 173 GiB it already has.\n2. **The first sync after the patch deletes stray files from the node copies** — `README.md`, `LICENSE`, `.gitattributes`, `.cache/huggingface/`, and `MANIFEST.sha256` (what `scripts/stage-weights.sh` writes). Excluding those files matches the precedent row and none are load-bearing, but the `MANIFEST.sha256` interaction is permanent, so the note calls it out as steady state rather than a fault.","ttft_ms":1625,"ttft_stream_ms":879,"time_to_request_ms":18,"type":"result","duration_ms":602549,"uuid":"2a2d8cb5-4aff-4045-b1a0-6368a797f17c"}
